ct-7539d7fa-752a-4c87-ab86-c9651dceb862"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Automatic loop recording ensures that older footage is overwritten when the SD card reaches capacity. The built-in G-sensor detects sudden impacts or vibrations, locking important footage to prevent it from being overwritten. Compatible with micro SD cards up to 256GB (includes a 64GB SD card). For other cards, we recommend using a Class 10 or higher microSD card from reliable brands like Samsung or SanDisk.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-63_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-64_"><img alt="a0a65d3e-2b87-4397-afa7-fd58656f6bc7.__CR0,0,1464,600_PT0_SX1464_V1___.jpg__PID:6b86c965-1dce-4862-9c37-f5f64bd4eca7" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/a0a65d3e-2b87-4397-afa7-fd58656f6bc7.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1.jpg?v=1735005821&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/a0a65d3e-2b87-4397-afa7-fd58656f6bc7.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1.jpg?v=1735005821&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/a0a65d3e-2b87-4397-afa7-fd58656f6bc7.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1.jpg?v=1735005821&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/a0a65d3e-2b87-4397-afa7-fd58656f6bc7.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1.jpg?v=1735005821&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/a0a65d3e-2b87-4397-afa7-fd58656f6bc7.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1.jpg?v=1735005821&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/a0a65d3e-2b87-4397-afa7-fd58656f6bc7.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1.jpg?v=1735005821&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/a0a65d3e-2b87-4397-afa7-fd58656f6bc7.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1.jpg?v=1735005821&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/